{"id":"632440","name":"蓝莓酱山药","author":"厨色","authorId":"12901915","desc":"","cover":"images/632440/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"铁棍山药","amount":"200克"}],"sub":[{"name":"迷迭香","amount":"1棵"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"铁棍山药备好。","img":"images/632440/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"去皮切段。","img":"images/632440/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放入蒸锅蒸15分钟。","img":"images/632440/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"这个时候调理酱汁，碗中放入蓝莓酱。","img":"images/632440/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入牛奶。","img":"images/632440/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"搅拌稀释。","img":"images/632440/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"时间到，山药蒸熟出锅。","img":"images/632440/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"浇上蓝莓汁。","img":"images/632440/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"用迷迭香装饰。","img":"images/632440/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"上桌即食。","img":"images/632440/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}